{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38386","headline":"彭门用兵後经汴路三首 三 · 吴融","name":"彭门用兵後经汴路三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁马云旗梦渺茫，东来无处不堪伤。\n风吹白草人行少，月落空城鬼啸长。\n一自纷争惊宇宙，可怜萧索绝烟光。\n曾爲塞北闲游客，辽水天山未断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}